      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be Gat hyrde . Gathyrde gebyreð his heorde meolc ofer martinus mæssedæig . 7 ær ðam his dæl hwæges .7 i. ticcen . of geares geo|goðe gif he his heorde wel begymeð.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the goatherd To the goatherd is due his herd’s milk on Martin’s Mass day, and before then his portion of whey, and one kid from the year’s young if he has looked after his herd well.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[15] Be gathyrde. Gathyrde gebyreð his heorde meolc ofer Martinus mæssedæig, 7 ær ðam his dæl hwæges 7 I ticcen of geares geogoðe, gif he his heorde wel begymeð.</ab>
      </div>
